			"notes": "Automatic Clipping Command: \n\nWe are thrilled to introduce a new command that enhances user convenience by automatically attempting to clip to a valid space below the current position. This feature eliminates the need for users to enter any additional arguments, saving valuable time.\n\nUpcoming Feature:\n\nIn our next release, we will be introducing the highly anticipated \"Clipping Up\" command. This command will further expand the capabilities of our system, allowing users to easily clip to valid spaces ABOVE their current position. Stay tuned for this exciting addition, as we continuously strive to enhance the functionality and versatility of our product.\n\nThank you for your continued support and feedback as we work towards delivering an exceptional user experience."
